  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到平油帽摘了大庆油田出油了，一到更凶险的难关就横在了面前。造原子弹的油矿被全世界都封锁起来，没有浓缩油，两弹就是一句空话。一九五五年一月，中央专门召开书记处扩大会议，讨论发展原子能事业。李四光带去了两样东西，国内发现的油矿石，还有从英国冒险带回的伽马探测仪。他当场给中央领导演示。仪器一靠近矿石嘎嘎作响。中国的地下有油油，就是这一声响定下了中国核工业的起点。从一九五四年起，李四光指导找油矿的队伍。在华南的崇山峻岭里，开展油矿普查，相继发现一系列油矿床，其中就包括特大型的二幺幺油矿船，正是这批矿石，撑起了我国第一颗原子弹的原料底气。一九六四年，戈壁滩，罗布泊内蘑菇云腾空而起。今天荣光的背后，藏着李四光和无数的地质人无声的坚守。石油油矿两件大事落的所有人，都以为这位为国家拼了大半辈子的老人终于可以歇歇了。可他偏不一九六六年河北邢台发生大地震，大地剧烈震颤，无数百姓流离失所。那一年，李四光七十六岁。他肚子里长着一个动脉瘤，随时可能破裂，奔波激动，都有性命之忧，身边所有人轮番劝阻，千万别去灾区，您这身体经不起折腾，可李四光说了一句话，让在场所有人都沉默了，他说，不要再阻拦我了。总理都去到灾区视察，我就是做这个工作的，怎么能贪生怕死呢？蹲了蹲，他又说了一句，藏在心底的话，地震预报这个难关总要有人去闯，我不来闯，谁来闯？他不顾生死，奔赴地震灾区，踏遍震后的土地，争分夺秒的研究地震预警系统。他提出用地应力测量、结合构造、应力场分析、再和活动构造的实地观测，拧成一股绳，给地震预报趟出一条新路。他是我国地震地质学的开路先锋。一九七零年，他以八十一岁高龄，仍跋山涉水，亲自去查看地震现象。有人劝他，您老这把年纪歇着吧。他摇头，地下的脾气还没磨透，我歇不下。一九七一年四月二十九日，八十二岁的李四光最终还是倒下了，住进了医院。弥留之际，他不问自己还能活多久，只问了一句话，还有多少时间可以安排剩下的科研工作？他走之后，人们翻开他的手稿，写满了地热海洋帝质地震预报的规划，没有一句关于自己的私事。每次看到这里，我心里久久不能平静。一个人一辈子坚守初心，已经很难。更难得的是，这份刻在骨子里的报国信念没有随他而去，而是顺着血脉传到了下一代。他的女儿李林英国博士毕业答辩一结束，不等学位证书，便立刻回到祖国国家。哪里缺科研人才，他就去哪里数次转换研究方向，一头扎进艰苦的核材料可言。女婿周成鲁学成后也是直接归国投身基础科学，是人工合成牛胰岛素的核心工程。后来，李林与周成鲁双双当选中科院院士、李四光、李林、邹成、鲁一门两代三院士。当年，孙中山那句努力，向学未为国用一代人的初心，成了两代人不变的信仰。回看李四光这一生，你会发现一条极清晰的线，十四岁名字填错了。他将错就错，定下了一生的方向。青年国家缺造船的，他学造船，国家缺采矿的。他学采矿，国家缺地质的，他转地质中年，全世界说中国没油。他不信四年，找到大庆油田，晚年油矿被封锁，他去找地震，没法预报。他去闯。身故后，女儿女婿接过那束光，继续照亮咱们这个国家。他曾说，我是炎黄的子孙，理所当然的要把所学到的知识全部献给我亲爱的祖国。他还说，不怀疑，不能见真。所以我希望大家都去怀疑态度，不要为已成的学说。所压达倒这两句朴素的话，一个讲立场，一个讲方法，合起来就是李四光一生的写照。今天当我们开车加满油，当我们抬头看见北斗族网、神州飞天，请不要忘了。在很久以前，有一个叫李四光的老人，用一支笔一张图，一双磨破的布鞋，把他的论文一笔一划写在了祖国的山河之上。他叫李四光，当年那个名字是填错的，可他用一生把这三个字写成了这个国家最硬的底气。如果你也被这位老人和他的一家人打动了，请点个关注，我会继续讲更多不该被遗忘的国之脊梁。点赞、收藏，把这条视频转发给你的家人和朋友，让更多人记住李四光，记住那些为我们拼过命的人，致敬国之脊梁。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 7220,
      "text": "上集说到平油帽摘了大庆油田出油了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 8000,
      "end_ms": 12160,
      "text": "一到更凶险的难关就横在了面前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 13180,
      "end_ms": 18944,
      "text": "造原子弹的油矿被全世界都封锁起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 20940,
      "end_ms": 22060,
      "text": "没有浓缩油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 22620,
      "end_ms": 24160,
      "text": "两弹就是一句空话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 24640,
      "end_ms": 26080,
      "text": "一九五五年一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 26440,
      "end_ms": 29240,
      "text": "中央专门召开书记处扩大会议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 29720,
      "end_ms": 31820,
      "text": "讨论发展原子能事业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 32840,
      "end_ms": 34880,
      "text": "李四光带去了两样东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36440,
      "end_ms": 38700,
      "text": "国内发现的油矿石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 39280,
      "end_ms": 42180,
      "text": "还有从英国冒险带回的伽马探测仪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 42640,
      "end_ms": 45160,
      "text": "他当场给中央领导演示。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 45320,
      "end_ms": 48220,
      "text": "仪器一靠近矿石嘎嘎作响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 48900,
      "end_ms": 50950,
      "text": "中国的地下有油油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 51350,
      "end_ms": 54990,
      "text": "就是这一声响定下了中国核工业的起点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 55650,
      "end_ms": 57310,
      "text": "从一九五四年起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 57590,
      "end_ms": 60225,
      "text": "李四光指导找油矿的队伍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 60920,
      "end_ms": 62800,
      "text": "在华南的崇山峻岭里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 62800,
      "end_ms": 64015,
      "text": "开展油矿普查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 64620,
      "end_ms": 66905,
      "text": "相继发现一系列油矿床，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 67380,
      "end_ms": 70575,
      "text": "其中就包括特大型的二幺幺油矿船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 71270,
      "end_ms": 72675,
      "text": "正是这批矿石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73060,
      "end_ms": 77015,
      "text": "撑起了我国第一颗原子弹的原料底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 77750,
      "end_ms": 78725,
      "text": "一九六四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 79190,
      "end_ms": 79790,
      "text": "戈壁滩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 79970,
      "end_ms": 82570,
      "text": "罗布泊内蘑菇云腾空而起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 82830,
      "end_ms": 84375,
      "text": "今天荣光的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84810,
      "end_ms": 88970,
      "text": "藏着李四光和无数的地质人无声的坚守。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 89210,
      "end_ms": 94230,
      "text": "石油油矿两件大事落的所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94230,
      "end_ms": 99845,
      "text": "都以为这位为国家拼了大半辈子的老人终于可以歇歇了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 100860,
      "end_ms": 105425,
      "text": "可他偏不一九六六年河北邢台发生大地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 105810,
      "end_ms": 107295,
      "text": "大地剧烈震颤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 107770,
      "end_ms": 109725,
      "text": "无数百姓流离失所。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 110130,
      "end_ms": 110615,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 110900,
      "end_ms": 112495,
      "text": "李四光七十六岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 113210,
      "end_ms": 115045,
      "text": "他肚子里长着一个动脉瘤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 115610,
      "end_ms": 117045,
      "text": "随时可能破裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 117900,
      "end_ms": 118965,
      "text": "奔波激动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 119230,
      "end_ms": 120530,
      "text": "都有性命之忧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 120670,
      "end_ms": 122710,
      "text": "身边所有人轮番劝阻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 122890,
      "end_ms": 124185,
      "text": "千万别去灾区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 124870,
      "end_ms": 127605,
      "text": "您这身体经不起折腾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 128410,
      "end_ms": 130085,
      "text": "可李四光说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 130810,
      "end_ms": 133545,
      "text": "让在场所有人都沉默了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 134700,
      "end_ms": 135175,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 136620,
      "end_ms": 137895,
      "text": "不要再阻拦我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138360,
      "end_ms": 140380,
      "text": "总理都去到灾区视察，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140720,
      "end_ms": 142135,
      "text": "我就是做这个工作的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 143130,
      "end_ms": 144705,
      "text": "怎么能贪生怕死呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 145660,
      "end_ms": 146245,
      "text": "蹲了蹲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 146580,
      "end_ms": 147540,
      "text": "他又说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 147540,
      "end_ms": 148715,
      "text": "藏在心底的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 149120,
      "end_ms": 152265,
      "text": "地震预报这个难关总要有人去闯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152780,
      "end_ms": 153505,
      "text": "我不来闯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153820,
      "end_ms": 154455,
      "text": "谁来闯？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 155170,
      "end_ms": 156355,
      "text": "他不顾生死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156700,
      "end_ms": 158140,
      "text": "奔赴地震灾区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158320,
      "end_ms": 159955,
      "text": "踏遍震后的土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160330,
      "end_ms": 163215,
      "text": "争分夺秒的研究地震预警系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163690,
      "end_ms": 171480,
      "text": "他提出用地应力测量、结合构造、应力场分析、再和活动构造的实地观测，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 171740,
      "end_ms": 172955,
      "text": "拧成一股绳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 173630,
      "end_ms": 176695,
      "text": "给地震预报趟出一条新路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 177600,
      "end_ms": 180495,
      "text": "他是我国地震地质学的开路先锋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 181420,
      "end_ms": 182455,
      "text": "一九七零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 182810,
      "end_ms": 184595,
      "text": "他以八十一岁高龄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 184940,
      "end_ms": 186145,
      "text": "仍跋山涉水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 186530,
      "end_ms": 188835,
      "text": "亲自去查看地震现象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 189420,
      "end_ms": 190365,
      "text": "有人劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 190800,
      "end_ms": 193105,
      "text": "您老这把年纪歇着吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 194140,
      "end_ms": 194965,
      "text": "他摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 196010,
      "end_ms": 197885,
      "text": "地下的脾气还没磨透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 199490,
      "end_ms": 200290,
      "text": "我歇不下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200510,
      "end_ms": 202655,
      "text": "一九七一年四月二十九日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 203380,
      "end_ms": 207155,
      "text": "八十二岁的李四光最终还是倒下了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 208080,
      "end_ms": 209115,
      "text": "住进了医院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 209930,
      "end_ms": 210775,
      "text": "弥留之际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 211470,
      "end_ms": 213735,
      "text": "他不问自己还能活多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 214750,
      "end_ms": 215975,
      "text": "只问了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216440,
      "end_ms": 220875,
      "text": "还有多少时间可以安排剩下的科研工作？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 221560,
      "end_ms": 222415,
      "text": "他走之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222740,
      "end_ms": 224340,
      "text": "人们翻开他的手稿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 224620,
      "end_ms": 229745,
      "text": "写满了地热海洋帝质地震预报的规划，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 230160,
      "end_ms": 232765,
      "text": "没有一句关于自己的私事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 233670,
      "end_ms": 234825,
      "text": "每次看到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 235170,
      "end_ms": 237225,
      "text": "我心里久久不能平静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 238580,
      "end_ms": 240600,
      "text": "一个人一辈子坚守初心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 240620,
      "end_ms": 241295,
      "text": "已经很难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 241980,
      "end_ms": 242965,
      "text": "更难得的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 243340,
      "end_ms": 247505,
      "text": "这份刻在骨子里的报国信念没有随他而去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 247810,
      "end_ms": 250865,
      "text": "而是顺着血脉传到了下一代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 252000,
      "end_ms": 256385,
      "text": "他的女儿李林英国博士毕业答辩一结束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 256750,
      "end_ms": 257985,
      "text": "不等学位证书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 258310,
      "end_ms": 261050,
      "text": "便立刻回到祖国国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261050,
      "end_ms": 262370,
      "text": "哪里缺科研人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 262550,
      "end_ms": 265775,
      "text": "他就去哪里数次转换研究方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 266090,
      "end_ms": 268575,
      "text": "一头扎进艰苦的核材料可言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 269190,
      "end_ms": 274950,
      "text": "女婿周成鲁学成后也是直接归国投身基础科学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 275010,
      "end_ms": 278145,
      "text": "是人工合成牛胰岛素的核心工程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 278880,
      "end_ms": 279440,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 279690,
      "end_ms": 288945,
      "text": "李林与周成鲁双双当选中科院院士、李四光、李林、邹成、鲁一门两代三院士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 289600,
      "end_ms": 290020,
      "text": "当年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 290060,
      "end_ms": 291840,
      "text": "孙中山那句努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291940,
      "end_ms": 296295,
      "text": "向学未为国用一代人的初心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 296790,
      "end_ms": 299135,
      "text": "成了两代人不变的信仰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 300290,
      "end_ms": 301910,
      "text": "回看李四光这一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 302570,
      "end_ms": 305250,
      "text": "你会发现一条极清晰的线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 305790,
      "end_ms": 308705,
      "text": "十四岁名字填错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 309310,
      "end_ms": 310750,
      "text": "他将错就错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 311050,
      "end_ms": 312670,
      "text": "定下了一生的方向。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 313710,
      "end_ms": 315890,
      "text": "青年国家缺造船的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 315910,
      "end_ms": 316790,
      "text": "他学造船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 317630,
      "end_ms": 319310,
      "text": "国家缺采矿的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 319970,
      "end_ms": 321030,
      "text": "他学采矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 321410,
      "end_ms": 323010,
      "text": "国家缺地质的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 323430,
      "end_ms": 325950,
      "text": "他转地质中年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 326370,
      "end_ms": 328150,
      "text": "全世界说中国没油。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 328870,
      "end_ms": 330430,
      "text": "他不信四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 330510,
      "end_ms": 331925,
      "text": "找到大庆油田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 334200,
      "end_ms": 336440,
      "text": "晚年油矿被封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 336780,
      "end_ms": 338200,
      "text": "他去找地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 338200,
      "end_ms": 338960,
      "text": "没法预报。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 339180,
      "end_ms": 339800,
      "text": "他去闯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 340280,
      "end_ms": 341060,
      "text": "身故后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 341300,
      "end_ms": 343520,
      "text": "女儿女婿接过那束光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 343780,
      "end_ms": 345660,
      "text": "继续照亮咱们这个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 346460,
      "end_ms": 347160,
      "text": "他曾说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347560,
      "end_ms": 349260,
      "text": "我是炎黄的子孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349860,
      "end_ms": 355540,
      "text": "理所当然的要把所学到的知识全部献给我亲爱的祖国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356400,
      "end_ms": 356980,
      "text": "他还说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 357060,
      "end_ms": 357700,
      "text": "不怀疑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 357780,
      "end_ms": 358540,
      "text": "不能见真。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 359000,
      "end_ms": 361160,
      "text": "所以我希望大家都去怀疑态度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 361500,
      "end_ms": 363440,
      "text": "不要为已成的学说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 363440,
      "end_ms": 366010,
      "text": "所压达倒这两句朴素的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 366470,
      "end_ms": 367550,
      "text": "一个讲立场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 367830,
      "end_ms": 368905,
      "text": "一个讲方法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 369430,
      "end_ms": 372245,
      "text": "合起来就是李四光一生的写照。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 373210,
      "end_ms": 375895,
      "text": "今天当我们开车加满油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 376470,
      "end_ms": 380385,
      "text": "当我们抬头看见北斗族网、神州飞天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 381380,
      "end_ms": 382225,
      "text": "请不要忘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 383960,
      "end_ms": 385155,
      "text": "在很久以前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 385710,
      "end_ms": 387755,
      "text": "有一个叫李四光的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 388390,
      "end_ms": 390715,
      "text": "用一支笔一张图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 391240,
      "end_ms": 392925,
      "text": "一双磨破的布鞋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 393430,
      "end_ms": 397985,
      "text": "把他的论文一笔一划写在了祖国的山河之上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 398790,
      "end_ms": 399855,
      "text": "他叫李四光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 400320,
      "end_ms": 402135,
      "text": "当年那个名字是填错的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 402400,
      "end_ms": 407565,
      "text": "可他用一生把这三个字写成了这个国家最硬的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 408230,
      "end_ms": 411645,
      "text": "如果你也被这位老人和他的一家人打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 411900,
      "end_ms": 412955,
      "text": "请点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 413270,
      "end_ms": 417535,
      "text": "我会继续讲更多不该被遗忘的国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 418910,
      "end_ms": 420095,
      "text": "点赞、收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 421590,
      "end_ms": 425065,
      "text": "把这条视频转发给你的家人和朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 425640,
      "end_ms": 427765,
      "text": "让更多人记住李四光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 428680,
      "end_ms": 431105,
      "text": "记住那些为我们拼过命的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b8c97ac01651049f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 432830,
      "end_ms": 434655,
      "text": "致敬国之脊梁。"
    }
  ],
